{"version":1,"key":"card:733","content":{"id":733,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8a77da80-2062-49b0-a5dd-c2caec0bb1e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Web 应用有时需要知道用户是否还在电脑前。在线协作工具想在用户离开时将状态切换为\"离开\"，游戏想把长时间不操作的玩家踢出房间释放资源，银行页面想在无人操作时自动锁定以保障安全，前端也希望在用户空闲时减少动画和轮询来降低性能开销，甚至可以配合 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":0,"contentId":5980,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"sendBeacon","collabId":"3d396181-43bf-42b7-85e3-3c3d0e7b3c21","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sendBeacon"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在用户离开前批量上报积攒的埋点数据。过去开发者只能通过监听鼠标和键盘事件自行计时，逻辑繁琐且不够准确。浏览器为此提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"IdleDetector API"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，让开发者可以直接获取用户的闲置状态。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7b427dd0-0e7b-4144-a06c-16b38f56ddb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"IdleDetector"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通过两个维度来判定闲置：一是用户是否在操作电脑，即在一段指定时间内有没有鼠标、键盘或触屏交互；二是屏幕是否被锁定。这两个维度的组合覆盖了绝大多数\"人不在电脑前\"的场景。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"85ef4d69-a01a-4f90-aa82-4523d41a154c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用前需要先获取用户授权，调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"await IdleDetector.requestPermission()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来请求权限。创建实例后，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法开始检测，该方法接收一个配置对象，包含两个选项："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"c8b7cbd2-6f15-4aad-9302-f7166318ceee","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"9a68c805-aa9c-4d93-ba5b-939bbe7271a5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b8c2a2fa-6f5d-49fa-831e-7e672a39c619","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"threshold"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：空闲时间阈值，超过这个时长未操作即被认为空闲，单位是毫秒，最小值为 60000（一分钟）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c37ed47f-12d6-4138-8179-4fbadf0c8f01","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7e5573dc-a9c2-41b3-847f-69077f670ffa","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"signal"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"AbortSignal"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"AbortController"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来随时结束监听"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"88be81cb-9b24-44e2-ad80-011d6c615b04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"开启检测后，每当状态发生变化都会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"change"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"addEventListener('change', callback)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来处理。实例对象上有两个只读属性："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"55c38b0b-c395-424c-b541-f676f52c5af4","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4884c29e-b7eb-49a6-8c9c-71f36197a18b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"76fa63c9-4571-4727-aedf-c0ed37e96304","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"userState"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：用户的操作状态，取值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"active\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"idle\""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ac85192c-ec7a-46fe-b519-81d75a7154bf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f41ce071-22db-4b81-8e4f-ed569ab5137e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"screenState"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：锁屏状态，取值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"locked\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"unlocked\""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"912afced-8942-4013-bb5b-73b54672524c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前访问这两个属性，返回值均为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0de8d3ca-4bdd-479a-b08e-e0c68f3eba96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一个完整的使用示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"175a592d-7322-4db1-a44a-6a33e680b389","collabId":"fd583b6b-64a3-4ed7-ad1e-f0b9ba39c06f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const controller = new AbortController();\nconst signal = controller.signal;\n\nstartButton.addEventListener(\"click\", async () => {\n  if ((await IdleDetector.requestPermission()) !== \"granted\") {\n    console.error(\"Idle detection permission denied.\");\n    return;\n  }\n\n  try {\n    const idleDetector = new IdleDetector();\n    idleDetector.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n      const userState = idleDetector.userState;\n      const screenState = idleDetector.screenState;\n      console.log(`Idle change: ${userState}, ${screenState}.`);\n    });\n\n    await idleDetector.start({\n      threshold: 60_000,\n      signal,\n    });\n    console.log(\"IdleDetector is active.\");\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error(err.name, err.message);\n  }\n});\n\nstopButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  controller.abort();\n  console.log(\"IdleDetector is stopped.\");\n});"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0f8b46e2-bf81-4078-9be1-b9fa1a77e34b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过这个 API 也有明显的局限："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"c3bb85cd-d055-4ac9-ba43-22a3c35435c3","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"8f7a75aa-8014-4fae-aead-e353f93ca04d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"46856f11-c4eb-4058-a83a-785e57750a9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"必须由用户手势触发权限请求，无法在后台静默开启检测"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7006df7a-0f65-40aa-9a93-6842b6e78a44","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"82e1135c-1c7e-404a-b102-fbbfe06543d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存在被滥用的风险，比如恶意脚本可能在检测到用户离开后进行挖矿，或在隐蔽位置展示欺诈广告"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4854f798-8a83-48af-9d29-e401c6a1add9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"12fd0f9b-052f-4936-9e8c-7dbd09e2e3d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器兼容性有限，目前只有 Chromium 内核的浏览器（Chrome、Edge 等）实现了该 API，Safari 和 Firefox 均未支持"}]}]}]}],"tags":["浏览器/IdleDetector","JavaScript"],"createTime":1779279344422,"updateTime":1790857850013,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1790857850013}}